      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 40,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and caring veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise Dr. Powers, Dr. Hall, and the front desk receptionists for their attentive manner and empathy. Many long-standing clients highlight that the team remains polite, attentive, and supportive during stressful visits. While an owner reported frustration over emergency scheduling, the overwhelming feedback is warm and appreciative."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 33,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and compassionate animal handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently observe that dogs and cats receive calm, reassuring care during physical check-ups and diagnostic tests. Nervous pets are given time to settle, with staff using low-stress handling methods throughout consultations. Pet parents express confidence that their animals feel safe and well looked after during inpatient procedures."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear communication and thorough explanations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate that veterinary doctors and clinical assistants take time to discuss test results and ongoing treatments in detail. Reviewers mention receiving clear instructions and helpful follow-up contact regarding their animals. Although one client felt diagnostic options were not adequately explained, most commend the team's transparent approach."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can urgent appointments be booked on the same day?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The practice prioritises scheduled visits, though urgent consultations during regular opening hours are accommodated where clinic capacity allows."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What diagnostic services are available at the hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hospital provides comprehensive on-site diagnostics, including digital radiology, ultrasound imaging, and routine blood tests."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are routine dental cleanings offered for pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients frequently mention booking preventive dental care and examinations under veterinary supervision."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Do veterinarians provide treatment plans before procedures?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers note that veterinary clinicians explain recommended treatments and provide cost breakdowns before undertaking procedures."
